# ==================================================
# LAB CONTROL PANEL / DECADE RESISTOR BOX
#
# CURRENT HARDWARE:
# - Pico / RP2040
# - Main 128x64 SSD1306 OLED on I2C0
# - Six rotary encoders and pushbuttons
# - MCP23017 #1 and #2
# - ULN2803 LED stand-ins / future relay drivers
# - TCA9548A on I2C1
# - Six 128x32 SSD1306 OLEDs on TCA channels 0 to 5
#
# FUTURE PROVISIONS:
# - Up to 12 logical RGBW LED zones
# - INA226 / INA228 voltage and current monitor
# - Temperature sensor and fan controller
# - Linear actuator H-bridge
# - Tool-presence sensors
#
# SAFE BOOT:
# GP15 ---- button/jumper ---- GND
#
# Hold GP15 LOW during reset/power-up to enter Safe Mode.
# Safe Mode prevents the main loop from starting.
# ==================================================


# ==================================================
